  Spanish (European/neutral) translation of values/strings.xml.

  Placeholders are POSITIONAL (%1$s / %1$d) and keep their numbers.
  Apostrophes and quotation marks are written RAW: Compose Multiplatform only
  unescapes \uXXXX, \n, \t and \\, so a backslash would reach the UI.
  "LatentJam" and "SMART" are names and stay untranslated.

  Terminology follows real players (Spotify, YouTube Music, Apple Music):
  canción, cola, reproducción aleatoria, lista de reproducción, biblioteca.
  Quotation marks are the Spanish angle quotes «…».
-->
